            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# p∞l 0.11.8

- Fixes Finder image and folder drops being mistaken for a stale in-app image drag.
- Falls back to the captured file when WebKit cannot resolve a dropped filesystem entry.
- Stops deleted pending images from keeping the shared caption queue visibly occupied.
]]></description>
