            <sparkle:version>0.11.7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# p∞l 0.11.7

- Fixes KILN exports by sending the rendered PNG directly to p∞l instead of wrapping it in a large base64 JSON request.
- Supports validated PNG exports up to 250 MB and saves them to the user's Downloads folder with a collision-safe filename.
- Keeps the existing local-session and KILN access checks on the export route.
]]></description>
