        <item>
            <title>0.11.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 13:43:06 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/matdryhurst/Pool</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.11.1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Pool 0.11.1

- Makes multi-image drops register much faster by refreshing the shared archive once per batch instead of once per file.
- Queues additional drops instead of silently rejecting them while another batch is uploading.
- Continues through a batch when one file fails and reports the exact failed file without losing the rest.
- Identifies images that were already present in the deduplicated archive instead of implying they were newly queued.
]]></description>
